'''Gordon and Mary's farm''' is a large [[list of farms|farm]] located in the [[Kebos Lowlands]] just north of the [[Kebos Swamp]]. The farm has small [[cabbage]] and [[onion]] fields, as well as pens with [[chicken]]s and [[cow]]s. A [[Barrel of flour (Gordon and Mary's farm)|barrel of flour]] is also located on the second floor of this farm. The [[quest]] [[Getting Ahead]] takes place here, with players helping [[Gordon]] and [[Mary]].

